#: ../html/src/manager/admin/config/monitoring-admin.tsx:41
msgid "The Taskomatic Prometheus exporter is up but the JMX configuration is disabled. Click the Enable button to enable the JMX configuration or click Disable to stop the Prometheus exporter."
